<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Owens-Illinois, Vitro begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Owens-Illinois, Vitro begun.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Joel Tiss said he initiated coverage of Owens-Illinois Inc with a buy rating and Vitro SA with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The final consolidation in the glass container business is upon us with Anchor Glass filing Chapter 11 and announcing its sale to Ball-Foster,&quot; Tiss said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Owens-Illinois was up 1/4 at 15-3/4 and Vitro was down 1/8 at 6-5/8.</p>
</text>
